WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.820
Here's your dinner.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.430
Aren't you going to eat?

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:14.100
Keep the hell out of my life!

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.640
I won't eat! Damn it!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.370
Mariko!

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:30.110
The main clause, "I heard.." is in the past tense,

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:34.120
...and the subordinate clause is in the past tense also.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:39.320
[Then Ruland picked up the scythe and created with it a circular space,]

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:44.930
[...three or four yards in diameter, just for the insect.]

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:51.200
[Then he told Jupiter to let the string go, and come down from the tree.]

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.070
Excuse me. My eraser...

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.560
Aren't we eating too much?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:17.430
It's OK, we're growing, you know!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.900
I just worry about growing sideways...

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.240
What's the matter?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.570
Shinobu-san?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.310
Yeah...

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.040
She's probably eating lunch alone somewhere. Who cares?

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:47.120
10. Mariko

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.200
What are you doing here?

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.210
Finished with lunch?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.280
I WILL NOT EAT!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.760
I don't want anything.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.970
Mariko, what do you want for dinner?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.770
Nothing, like I said.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.510
But it's been three days.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.650
How about a steak?

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.510
With lots of French fries! Hmm?

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.250
I told you I don't want anything!

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.920
Go away!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.120
Mariko...

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.530
Don't you see how unhappy this makes me?

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:59.000
Please eat something. For my sake.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.870
You are all that is precious in my life.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.270
There isn't anything else for me.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.740
Please, Mariko? Won't you?

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.340
"Please", "please"!

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.880
Can't you say anything but "please"?!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.140
Get angry!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.750
Being like THAT is what made my father... made him...

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.150
Go away!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.090
Get out! Get out!

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.420
Get out!

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.370
Let's see... "confusion"...

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.570
What is the synonym of "confusion"...?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.500
That's odd...

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.840
A page is missing!

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.910
Geez, what am I doing with this cheap dictionary...?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.710
May I come in, Nanako?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:49.110
Dad!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.580
You've been studying so hard lately!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.320
Yes, you know mid-terms are coming soon.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.320
Here. A reward for you.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.920
Great! An English-to-English dictionary!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.260
So... "confusion"... "confusion"...

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.470
How did you know I needed a new dictionary?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.070
He was watching you study in the living room the other day.

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.810
Oh! Thank you, Daddy.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.810
Here's a dessert for you. Keep up the good work!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.880
I made your favorite... apple pie!

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:31.090
Brother, dear brother...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:36.360
I am surrounded by the warmth of my father's love, and my mother's too.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.960
I realize how happy I am.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.440
I don't think I care how they met.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:49.770
But brother...

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.650
...I just don't understand about Mariko-san.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.340
Call again...!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.070
Please. Please...!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.140
Nanako-san!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.350
My first section is Physics, rats!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.750
Mine is English.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.090
Nanako, sheesh, you're really working hard...!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.760
Of course. I have a new dictionary!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.830
Shinobu-san?

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:44.560
Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi!

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.830
Good morning!

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:51.440
Oh good! Fukiko-sama has a favor to ask of you both...

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.170
Fukiko-sama??

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.510
She wants us?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.640
So! See you at lunch!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:04.720
Could you bring flowers for the tea ceremony today?

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.450
From the College Union?

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.590
Flowers for a tea ceremony?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.120
We will rely on your good taste.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.860
Misonoo-san, you seem reluctant...?

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.060
No...!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.530
If you would be so kind, then...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.070
The Sorority holds a tea ceremony once a week.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:30.480
Afterwards they discuss upcoming events and such...

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.010
These ceremonies are so important!

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.950
To think we'd be chosen to select the flowers!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:40.020
What an honor it is! It's wonderful!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.090
Don't you think so too?

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:43.290
Yeah...

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.760
About the other day...

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.430
Misonoo-san, I really...

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:17.060
A Tea Ceremony? What an elegant life!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.260
So then? You two picked the flowers, right?

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:20.860
Yeah...

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.070
I was right about that birthday party.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.670
Something happened, didn't it?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:33.070
It's OK. If you can't talk about it...

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.080
Thanks.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.300
I figured you'd be here.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.360
Here's one for you.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:02.370
So skinny! You're wasting your natural beauty.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.100
Please leave me alone.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:06.370
You're so pale.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:09.980
You can't go on abusing your health this way.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.310
Leave me alone.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:15.320
What good is health? Who cares about health!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.720
You don't care!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.060
You're talking nonsense!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.400
You wouldn't say that if you weren't still healthy.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:34.470
Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.070
...you just don't understand how I feel!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.490
Can't you see just a little...?

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:03.030
You've always been adored by so many... Can't you see?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.900
Oh wow, I want a hug from Kaoru-no-Kimi too!

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:11.770
Hey, me too! <b> </b>

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.240
Hey, me too! Me too!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:12.710
Me too!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.460
All right, everybody...!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.730
Quiet down and get ready for Taiku.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:35.860
OK! OK! OK!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.400
I'll get you warmed up!

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.400
You too, Misonoo-san.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.540
OK...

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.880
OK! Are you ready to take a serve?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.810
Oh, no... Her serve is so strong!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.750
She's such an athlete!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.550
Heads up! Go!

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:50.070
My nap was interrupted by your ball.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.070
It figures, that it was you...

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.280
It's Saint-Juste-sama!

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.210
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.280
Rei, throw the ball back, already!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:07.560
Why don't you come up instead of playing with this stupid ball.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.690
The view from here is splendid.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:15.030
Everything looks small and beautiful.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:19.900
Even people.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.910
Orihara Kaoru looks small too. From here.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.640
Stop the nonsense, come down. I'll let you join us!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.850
That would be a pleasure!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:33.850
Saint Juste-sama!

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:46.800
Rei! Throw the ball!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.890
Rei! Stop that!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.030
She'll jump!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.190
Saint-Juste...

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.130
Angel of Death.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:54.730
Back with it, everyone. Don't bother with this lazybones!

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.400
Shinobu-san!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.670
Help! <b> </b>

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:04.540
Help! What happened?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.280
Hurry! To the nurse's office!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.350
Aren't you coming with us?

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:11.750
Yes.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:43.780
I heard about her. My god!

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.780
Yes! And she's unconscious!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:46.580
What!

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.320
And I can't reach her mother.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:52.460
I'm going to go to her house.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.990
Her mom might still be out.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.660
I'll wait for her in front...

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:01.870
...it's best for her to be told in person, because of the shock.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:03.600
Yes, good!

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:06.600
I want to help her as much as I can...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.470
...because despite everything, she is my friend.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.410
I'll take your purse home for you.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.880
Thank you! That will help.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.100
Darling...

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:00.260
What? Hospitalized?

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:02.790
Orihara-san just called to tell me...

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.460
She needs to stay in the hospital for a couple of days.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.930
Yes, it's not that serious.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.130
They say it's anemia and malnutrition.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:11.940
Malnutrition?

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.140
Did you talk to her mother yet?

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.340
Not yet.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.220
Stupid.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.630
Stupid girl.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.700
Abusing her precious life like that...

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.510
These kids... how could they...?

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.920
Shinobu-san suffering from malnutrition...?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.860
Malnutrition? How could that happen?

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.070
Misonoo-san! You've come!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.470
Thank you thank you!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:28.950
Excuse me but... Mariko-san has fainted!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.350
Mariko... fainted?!?

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:42.630
What! Mariko stopped eating because of me?

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:46.360
She won't eat until you forgive her...

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.370
Not even a bite.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.240
No more than a sip of tea.

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:57.110
Oh, no... Oh no!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:14.130
That was Shinobu-san asking for... forgiveness.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:19.400
She wanted to wait as long as it took until you forgave her...

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.330
...of your own accord.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:22.670
That girl...!

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:26.200
I didn't know. I had no idea!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.540
There was nothing I could do.

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:37.280
I'd made up my mind to force her to eat something today.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:45.020
She probably was hoping I would. I finally realized that.

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:50.160
Brother, brother...!

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.770
Mariko-san... Mariko-san was...

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.970
It was all because of me... I...

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.920
Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.250
You've stayed with me all this time?

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:20.590
Your mother will be here soon, Misonoo-san, too.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.930
Just like I figured.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.530
No. I didn't...

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:31.540
Nevermind. Put an end to this foolishness.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.280
Mariko?

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:41.210
How are you? Are you really all right?

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:47.090
Mariko, Nanako-san is here.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.230
How do you feel?

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:06.970
What? I don't need you. I have a lot of friends.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.650
Well, I'll be leaving now.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.180
Bye!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:35.270
See, I missed saying goodbye to Kaoru-no-Kimi, because of you!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:41.870
Damn... as for you, you aren't my only friend!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:46.680
Really, I swear!

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:50.220
My life is completely full... of so many friends!

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.140
My dear brother...

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:47.810
To forgive her, or not to forgive her...

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:52.680
Who am I to be so judgmental or presumptuous?

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:01.220
The school called my publishing company...

00:23:01.890 --> 00:23:03.620
Thank you, dear.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:10.700
Mariko-san is facing loneliness, and her own self, head on.

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:16.640
If it were me, I'd try to ignore it or try to avoid it..

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:21.980
She's 16, same as me.

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:24.780
She's a 16-year old hero.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:26.380
Bravo!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.680 --> 00:25:04.080
Preview

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:09.020
While waiting for Fukiko in a heavy rainstorm under an elm tree...

00:25:09.150 --> 00:25:11.550
Rei gets a high fever and collapses.

00:25:12.350 --> 00:25:15.290
When Nanako takes Rei to her apartment,

00:25:15.490 --> 00:25:18.760
...she is shocked to find the room filled with mirrors!

00:25:19.160 --> 00:25:20.160
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:20.160 --> 00:25:21.960
Next episode: Under the Elm Tree

00:25:22.100 --> 00:25:23.830
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:23.830 --> 00:25:26.430
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
